  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "CKAN REST API",
    "version": "2.11.0",
    "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 specification for the CKAN Open Data Portal API, split into subfiles using JSON `$ref` references.\n\n## Architecture\n\nCKAN exposes a single RPC-style **Action API** endpoint. All actions are called by POST (or GET for read-only actions) to:\n\n```\nPOST /api/3/action/{action_name}\nGET  /api/3/action/{action_name}?param=value\n```\n\nEvery response is a JSON envelope `{success, result, error, help}`. Check `success` before using `result`.\n\n## Authentication\n\nPass an API token in the `Authorization` header (preferred) or legacy `X-CKAN-API-Key` header.\nGenerate tokens at **User Profile \u2192 Manage \u2192 API Tokens** or via `api_token_create`.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nopenapi.json                          \u2190 root entry point\ncomponents/\n  schemas/          (23 files)         \u2190 shared data models\n  parameters/       (4 files)          \u2190 shared parameters\n  responses/        (4 files)          \u2190 shared error responses\n  securitySchemes/  (2 files)\npaths/\n  core_get/         (29 files)         \u2190 read-only CKAN core actions\n  core_create/      (14 files)         \u2190 create actions\n  core_update/      (12 files)         \u2190 update/replace actions\n  core_patch/       (5 files)          \u2190 partial update actions\n  core_delete/      (19 files)         \u2190 delete/purge actions\n  core_file/        (6 files)          \u2190 CKAN 2.12+ File API\n  datastore/        (10 files)         \u2190 ckanext-datastore\n  filestore/        (1 file)           \u2190 DataStore dump download\n  activity/         (15 files)         \u2190 ckanext-activity\n  harvest/          (13 files)         \u2190 ckanext-harvest\n  spatial/          (1 file)           \u2190 ckanext-spatial\n  dcat/             (3 files)          \u2190 ckanext-dcat\n```\n\n## Coverage\n\n**Core API** (ckan.logic.action): `package_*`, `resource_*`, `group_*`, `organization_*`, `user_*`, `tag_*`, `vocabulary_*`, `member_*`, `api_token_*`, `config_option_*`, `job_*`, `file_*`\n\n**ckanext-datastore**: `datastore_create`, `datastore_upsert`, `datastore_search`, `datastore_search_sql`, `datastore_delete`, `datastore_records_delete`, `datastore_info`, `datastore_run_triggers`, `datastore_function_create/delete`\n\n**ckanext-activity**: activity stream listing, creating, diffing, deleting, email notifications\n\n**ckanext-harvest**: `harvest_source_*`, `harvest_job_*`, `harvest_object_*`, `harvesters_info_show`\n\n**ckanext-spatial**: `ext_bbox` bounding-box search extension to `package_search`\n\n**ckanext-dcat**: `/catalog.{format}`, `/dataset/{id}.{format}`, Schema.org structured data\n\n**FileStore (dump)**: `GET /datastore/dump/{resource_id}`",
